    <div class="content-block" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);"><p>Compliance is an overlay, not a control point, so there is no standalone integration to run. You point your existing screening, monitoring and KYC stack at the structured, field-tagged output ioNova ARS already produces. As soon as the upstream edition’s plan completes (3–4 weeks for a single corporate, 10–16 weeks across an enterprise estate), screening can read the structured fields and the false-positive reduction and audit benefits accrue immediately — no change to the engine, monitor or KYC platform, only to the quality of their input.</p></div>
